#: src/model/w42-template.c:407
msgid "About 80,000 words"
msgstr "نحو 80,000 كلمة"

#. Translators: Surname and TITLE are the words of "Surname / TITLE";
#. * View and Header and Footer are the menu items of that name.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:411
msgid ""
"The story begins here. Replace Surname and TITLE in View ▸ Header and Footer "
"with your own; the page number follows them on every page but the first."
msgstr ""
"تبدأ القصة هنا. استبدل «اسم العائلة» و«العنوان» في عرض ◂ رأس وتذييل الصفحة "
"باسمك وعنوانك؛ ويليهما رقم الصفحة في كل صفحة عدا الأولى."

#. Translators: the "#" on the line above is the break meant.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:417
msgid "A scene break is a hash mark on a line of its own."
